WEBVTT

00:43:59.735 --> 00:44:04.077
by the actions that you're taking
as a philanthropist

00:44:04.101 --> 00:44:05.831
in this moment.

00:44:05.855 --> 00:44:07.545
And some of your peers,

00:44:07.569 --> 00:44:09.760
you know, there are amazing
stories out there.

00:44:09.784 --> 00:44:12.570
I was really struck by Jack Dorsey's
announcement yesterday

00:44:12.594 --> 00:44:14.791
of his huge philanthropic contribution.

00:44:14.815 --> 00:44:19.816
And, I mean, that's awesome,
but equally important, I was --

00:44:19.840 --> 00:44:21.418
RD: But it's not nearly enough.

00:44:21.442 --> 00:44:22.783
CA: Exactly, and I'm --

00:44:22.807 --> 00:44:24.569
CH: It would be good to see more.

00:44:24.593 --> 00:44:27.426
CA: I'm kind of dismayed, in a way,

00:44:27.450 --> 00:44:30.545
to hear you say that you're 60/40
leaning pessimistic,